        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "67ba33c2-73fb-3bbf-9199-12847f83bc88",
                "word": "meerekenen",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "49a545d3-669a-3bc7-a59a-c0694a504618",
                        "entry_id": "67ba33c2-73fb-3bbf-9199-12847f83bc88",
                        "glosses": [
                            "meetellen in het geheel, meenemen in een berekening"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "364daea6-bed5-456a-9605-8c98fcda08a9",
                                "sense_id": "49a545d3-669a-3bc7-a59a-c0694a504618",
                                "text": "Per saldo bewogen Amerikaanse aandelen nauwelijks (als we de massale verkoop van Aziatische stukken op de dag van de uitslag niet meerekenen). Nog sterker, ze stegen in de weken na de verkiezingsuitslag naar een nieuwe recordhoogte."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a538b93c-8f69-448c-bc87-88cc48c69acb",
                                "sense_id": "49a545d3-669a-3bc7-a59a-c0694a504618",
                                "text": "De resultaten vertkenen, aldus analisten van Jefferies, vanwege het niet langer meerekenen van enkele btw-voordelen voor KPN."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2cab409-1334-48a7-b12b-f867fd61ebd5",
                                "sense_id": "49a545d3-669a-3bc7-a59a-c0694a504618",
                                "text": "Het algemene beeld dat Hofland heeft van de jaarwisseling is dat deze 'rustig'is verlopen. \"Toch is het jammer dat er opnieuw mensen menen om eigendommen van anderen te moeten vernielen. We hebben nu alleen nog maar een beeld van de schade aan openbare eigendommen. Als de we de schade aan particuliere eigendommen, maar ook van beschadigde bushaltes, meerekenen, komen we op een nog veel hoger bedrag uit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "758f867d-808b-409f-af04-2a8d84e89784",
                                "sense_id": "49a545d3-669a-3bc7-a59a-c0694a504618",
                                "text": "Het nieuwe kabinet wil het eigenwoningforfait weer meerekenen als inkomsten voor mensen die hun huis hebben afgelost. Maar die mensen trekken al jaren geen rente af en dragen dus meer bij aan de belastingen. Het zijn vaak ouderen en die hebben er al jaren niets bij gehad of zelfs ingeleverd op hun pensioen. Ik ben er best boos over dat op deze manier steeds dezelfde groep wordt 'gepakt'."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9236e970-e92a-4a7b-881d-dff9d81d72a1",
                        "source_entry_id": "67ba33c2-73fb-3bbf-9199-12847f83bc88",
                        "source_sense_id": "49a545d3-669a-3bc7-a59a-c0694a504618",
                        "target_lang_word": "figure in",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7a8aa14f-1030-449d-bc17-bebad8e20ae4",
                        "source_entry_id": "67ba33c2-73fb-3bbf-9199-12847f83bc88",
                        "source_sense_id": "49a545d3-669a-3bc7-a59a-c0694a504618",
                        "target_lang_word": "count in",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "count in",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a2d0b12-e5e3-318c-95ad-e4abb222fe51",
                                        "entry_id": "b7d2c4fc-241a-31a5-92e3-c6ab1b3e9323",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To include (someone) in an activity, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c78934b-2799-4c0c-b936-965eacbe8c29",
                                                "sense_id": "5a2d0b12-e5e3-318c-95ad-e4abb222fe51",
                                                "text": "You're going to the beach? Count me in!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38aca174-472d-35d7-a4ec-3adaa2df010e",
                                        "entry_id": "b7d2c4fc-241a-31a5-92e3-c6ab1b3e9323",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To do a countdown before the start of something, especially a musical performance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da950cd8-6cd1-4976-8af1-e099ee7e5fe2",
                                                "sense_id": "38aca174-472d-35d7-a4ec-3adaa2df010e",
                                                "text": "The drummer will count us in with a \"three-two-one\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9c9941d7-f887-462c-a8b3-81982242b7e2",
                        "source_entry_id": "67ba33c2-73fb-3bbf-9199-12847f83bc88",
                        "source_sense_id": "49a545d3-669a-3bc7-a59a-c0694a504618",
                        "target_lang_word": "include",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "include",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a187588c-45c0-3a14-a590-98a4a88e0b96",
                                        "entry_id": "9320e3fd-7489-3e9d-913c-e4572c0f0508",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bring into a group, class, set, or total as a (new) part or member."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "971c79a1-ae6f-4a05-8c4a-7dd90aa4f75f",
                                                "sense_id": "a187588c-45c0-3a14-a590-98a4a88e0b96",
                                                "text": "I will purchase the vacation package if you will include car rental."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fdc72cab-0ef1-33ac-9942-d889f21acbba",
                                        "entry_id": "9320e3fd-7489-3e9d-913c-e4572c0f0508",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To consider as part of something; to comprehend."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a801ecc0-8768-47f7-912a-29966e1cdaa2",
                                                "sense_id": "fdc72cab-0ef1-33ac-9942-d889f21acbba",
                                                "text": "The vacation package includes car rental."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76ab9c2b-1578-4add-ac9b-a38b50509720",
                                                "sense_id": "fdc72cab-0ef1-33ac-9942-d889f21acbba",
                                                "text": "Does this volume of Shakespeare include his sonnets?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ea2d5ee-81b4-480a-b1c7-b442fef2b08c",
                                                "sense_id": "fdc72cab-0ef1-33ac-9942-d889f21acbba",
                                                "text": "I was included in the invitation to the family gathering."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ae936f2-e375-49f1-a3e8-fa9c582bc3ba",
                                                "sense_id": "fdc72cab-0ef1-33ac-9942-d889f21acbba",
                                                "text": "up to and including page twenty-five"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f0ccbc5-e909-435d-9f5e-036b413fdd6d",
                                                "sense_id": "fdc72cab-0ef1-33ac-9942-d889f21acbba",
                                                "text": "The whole included race, his purposed prey."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76596291-41e6-4909-9f68-a01e43258b31",
                                                "sense_id": "fdc72cab-0ef1-33ac-9942-d889f21acbba",
                                                "text": "The loss of such a lord includes all harm."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a0d418f-da2e-3dfc-a33a-69a2ac500bbf",
                                        "entry_id": "9320e3fd-7489-3e9d-913c-e4572c0f0508",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To enclose, confine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d004ddb0-736d-4c68-9688-3675370815c2",
                                                "sense_id": "7a0d418f-da2e-3dfc-a33a-69a2ac500bbf",
                                                "text": "I could have here willingly ranged, but these straits wherein I am included will not permit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e52b5e80-19fb-3c24-9502-bb67f03e4499",
                                        "entry_id": "9320e3fd-7489-3e9d-913c-e4572c0f0508",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To conclude; to terminate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "705dc86c-e451-4076-9ccc-b446b4b5490e",
                                                "sense_id": "e52b5e80-19fb-3c24-9502-bb67f03e4499",
                                                "text": "Come, let us go; we will include all jars / With triumphs, mirth, and rare solemnity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99a1ae24-99ac-3564-8440-82861f5ea0fd",
                                        "entry_id": "9320e3fd-7489-3e9d-913c-e4572c0f0508",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To use a directive that allows the use of source code from another file."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec050c89-48c3-416e-8181-4999862e0fcf",
                                                "sense_id": "99a1ae24-99ac-3564-8440-82861f5ea0fd",
                                                "text": "You have to include the strings library to use this function."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
